{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Datquinso Desktop Pets!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These pets are cute, expressive, and most importantly, low-profile.<br>They\u2019re designed to keep you company without getting in your way \u2014 whether you're working, gaming, streaming, or just chilling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don\u2019t interact with them, they\u2019ll simply hang out on your screen until someone (or something!) wakes them up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc3e Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 Customize</strong><br>Choose from a variety of fur styles, faces, and clothing options to make each pet unique and stylish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Play</strong><br>Pets will bounce around, chase toys, stack on top of each other, and even grab your mouse (if you let them). You can also give them head pats :3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcac <strong>Stream</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your pets aren\u2019t just cute \u2014 they love your community! Watch them react in real-time to Twitch chat messages and commands.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude34 Sleep</strong><br>When you\u2019re away, your pets will cling to nearby windows or the taskbar and take naps. Give them a little shake or a gentle pat to wake them up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd1d Share</strong><br>Send your favorite pets to friends using the built-in friends menu. Just exchange friend codes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcec Visit</strong><br>Pets marked as friends will occasionally visit your desktop, joining your main pet for a surprise appearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf3f Care</strong><br>Your pets gently remind you to drink water, take breaks, and offer a few kind words to keep your spirits up during long sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd12 Privacy</strong><br>This app stays offline unless you choose to connect to Twitch and does not collect ANY data from your system. It\u2019s fully offline by design \u2014 even friend codes work without a connection. No guessing, no tracking, just pets.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3897940?t=1755320109","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3897940?t=1755320109","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897940/21847ff22767ee72bbb634d686243ab1d63bc60c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755320109","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897940/21847ff22767ee72bbb634d686243ab1d63bc60c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755320109","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3898100,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Datquinso Desktop Pets!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These pets are cute, expressive, and most importantly, low-profile.<br>They\u2019re designed to keep you company without getting in your way \u2014 whether you're working, gaming, streaming, or just chilling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don\u2019t interact with them, they\u2019ll simply hang out on your screen until someone (or something!) wakes them up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc3e Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 Customize</strong><br>Choose from a variety of fur styles, faces, and clothing options to make each pet unique and stylish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Play</strong><br>Pets will bounce around, chase toys, stack on top of each other, and even grab your mouse (if you let them). You can also give them head pats :3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcac <strong>Stream</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your pets aren\u2019t just cute \u2014 they love your community! Watch them react in real-time to Twitch chat messages and commands.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude34 Sleep</strong><br>When you\u2019re away, your pets will cling to nearby windows or the taskbar and take naps. Give them a little shake or a gentle pat to wake them up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd1d Share</strong><br>Send your favorite pets to friends using the built-in friends menu. Just exchange friend codes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcec Visit</strong><br>Pets marked as friends will occasionally visit your desktop, joining your main pet for a surprise appearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf3f Care</strong><br>Your pets gently remind you to drink water, take breaks, and offer a few kind words to keep your spirits up during long sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd12 Privacy</strong><br>This app stays offline unless you choose to connect to Twitch and does not collect ANY data from your system. It\u2019s fully offline by design \u2014 even friend codes work without a connection. No guessing, no tracking, just pets.</p>","developers":["Datquinso"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897940/2fccf8dacc3e054f466a7ed1b6492b3366d35679/header.jpg?t=1755320109","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3897940/2109322113/a2cb6d05d3d28d1a6e1a1284e2cac2065a04f632/1754755921/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754759371","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3897940/2109322113/a